WEBVTT

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.960
Stop moping just because you lost.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.670
That's right.  You did your best.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.890
But…

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.910
Just win your next duel.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.440
The experience of losing never goes to waste.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:24.100
Yusei, don't you dare lose.  We'll 
be cheering you on from the stands.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.950
What's up with her?

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:06.390
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:11.390
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:19.930
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:25.930
Break through even further

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:31.410
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:38.600
There's always only one truth

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:42.430
So feel the voice of your heart

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:47.190
With your unwavering emotions

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:53.320
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:28.290
Reunion with the WitchThe Dragon 
of Destruction Black Rose Dragon

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:32.090
What?  That girl is a Signer?

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:35.840
It's your job to investigate if that's true.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:40.790
Act like a hunting dog and pressure the 
girl until she reveals her true identity.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:45.170
I am Jill deLauncebeaux, known by the 
people as the knight of steel and blood.

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:49.320
I'm a hunting dog chasing 
after a girl?  You insult me.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:56.470
What if I say that her true 
identity is the Black Rose Witch?

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.170
What?  Witch?

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:02.480
You've heard of the masked 
woman with frightening power

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:06.280
that is terrorizing Daimon 
Area's duel fields.

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:10.000
She has the power to make 
damage in duels become real.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:16.890
This duel will become a competition 
where you'll risk your life.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.680
If you want to back down, now's your chance.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:24.600
What?  It's the job of a 
knight to hunt evil people!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.220
I will terminate the witch!

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.570
Leave it to me!

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:40.710
Our hero makes his entrance!

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:44.910
The blood and iron knight of 
justice!  The veteran hero!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.940
What kind of duel will he show us today?

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:51.660
Jill deLauncebeaux!

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.960
I swear on this sword!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:04:00.830
As the descendant of the ancient 
knights, I will conquer this duel!

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:06.120
Jill deLauncebeaux has 
already declared victory!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.060
He's very popular.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:13.080
He's a jerk who brags about 
justice, but his skills are real.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:16.730
His opponent in this duel makes her entrance!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.820
Along with battle experience and skill, the 
beautiful woman also brings many mysteries!

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:26.590
Will we witness the birth 
of a new prodigy today?

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:29.330
Aki Izayoi!

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:32.810
I feel like I've seen her before.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.140
We just met her a little while ago.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:38.360
No, not then.  Sometime before that.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.330
What's wrong?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.620
Her deck…

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.290
It seems to be in pain.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.060
So this girl is the Black Rose Witch.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.210
Even if you're a girl, I 
will show you no mercy!

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.130
Show me the duel of a knight!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.350
Duel!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.390
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:23.720
I summon Masked Knight LV3!

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:34.960
Its monster effect activates!  Persona Blast!

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:40.170
You take 400 points of damage!

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:43.790
Then I activate a spell card!  Level Up!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:50.570
I send Masked Knight LV3 to the graveyard 
to Special Summon Masked Knight LV5!

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:57.690
Masked Knight LV5's monster effect!

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:00.350
Persona Twin Blast!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:05.000
You take 1000 points of damage!

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:10.580
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:15.800
Due to an overwhelming attack, Izayoi 
has taken 1400 points of damage

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:18.400
before her turn has even started!

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:23.240
Jill is attacking furiously from the start.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:27.620
At this rate, uncovering the witch's 
identity is only a matter of time.

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:35.520
I bet the evolving Knight strikes 
fear to your very bones!

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:40.860
You have nothing to say?  
You're a spooky girl.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:45.030
I draw.  I summon Wall of 
Ivy in defense position.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.060
A defense monster.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.220
It looks like she's going to focus 
on defending from the start.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:58.720
Then from my hand, I activate the 
spell card Seed of Deception.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:03.750
It lets me summon a Level 
2-or-below Plant-Type Monster.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:09.890
I Special Summon the Level 1 Tuner 
Monster Copy Plant in defense position.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.170
Copy Plant's monster effect.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:21.750
Copy Plant becomes the same Level 
as a monster on your field.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:30.680
It copied the Level of Masked Knight LV5.

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:36.930
What is she planning to 
do by raising its Level?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.080
Isn't it obvious?

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.180
A Synchro Summon!

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:46.120
Level 5 Copy Plant tunes Level 2 Wall of Ivy.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:50.780
The cold flame envelops the entire world.

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:54.120
Black flower, bloom!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.890
Synchro Summon!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:02.390
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.770
What is that?

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:20.420
Witch, you already revealed 
your true identity?

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:21.740
Witch?

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:25.410
I know what that is!  The masked 
witch uses that monster!

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:29.110
She already brought it out.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.860
It's a detestable mark!

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.950
Black Rose Dragon?

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:50.990
The bad luck dragon that brings destruction.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:53.300
It looks like you've seen it before.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.070
It's the witch!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.490
Black Rose Witch has appeared!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.950
It's the witch!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.650
The witch is here!

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:18.790
Witch!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:24.640
No matter what ace you pull out of your 
sleeve, my steel heart will not skip a beat!

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:29.610
I'll strike back at you with Sakuretsu 
Armor I have set on my field.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:35.300
What's with that look in your eyes?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.270
Black Rose Dragon's monster effect activates.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:43.380
When Black Rose Dragon is Special Summoned, 
all cards on the field are destroyed.

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.270
What?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.160
Black Rose Gale!

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:55.240
What's happening?  A gale has 
surrounded the entire arena!

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.850
So this is the power of the witch.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.660
I set one card.  Then...

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:12.680
The Field Spell Black Garden.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.930
This is…

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:19.910
A garden where evil creatures hide?

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.040
I end my turn.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:25.600
Be careful of the witch's trap!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:29.320
Thank you for your support!  
But there's no need to worry!

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.060
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.990
From my hand, I activate the spell 
card The Warrior Returning Alive.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:44.100
Due to this, I can add one Warrior-Type 
monster in my graveyard to my hand!

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:48.940
Masked Knight LV3, return to me!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.310
Warriors that have pride are immortal!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.330
Masked Knight!

00:10:56.860 --> 00:11:03.010
As long as Black Garden is faceup, a 
monster's attack points are halved,

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:09.650
and a Rose Token is automatically summoned 
to the opponent's field in attack position.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.610
You're inside the Black Garden.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:17.190
This hellish garden feeds on monsters' 
lives to make the flowers bloom.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:23.180
Masked Knight's attack points 
can't stand up to Rose Token!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:27.800
Even if it has less attack points, 
it still has its monster effect.

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:29.720
Your plan was a waste!

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:32.210
Persona Blast!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.600
How's that!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.980
I activate the trap card Doppelganger.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:45.590
When I take damage from a monster effect, 
you take the same amount of damage.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:50.450
Whoa!  Though he was unharmed until now, 
Jill's life points have finally decreased!

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:52.710
A scar!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.410
You're right.  He's hurt.

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:56.380
He was hurt during a duel?

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.640
This is scary!

00:11:58.640 --> 00:11:59.520
You witch!

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.290
How dare you!

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:01.430
Go away!

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:05.580
So the witch uses her powers 
to hurt the opponent for real.

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:08.820
Who are you?

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.100
I'm different than all of you.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:15.920
Witch, what are you scheming to do?

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:20.120
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:21.740
I draw.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:25.060
I activate the Equip Spell Mark of the Rose.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:28.680
With this, I take control 
of one of your monsters.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:32.510
Masked Knight LV3 comes to me.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:45.190
The monster switched allegiances.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:50.100
Feel the pain of the sword of betrayal.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.250
Masked Knight LV3 attacks you directly!

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:09.080
You switched a monster's allegiance.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:12.030
You really are a witch.  
You fight in an evil way.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:18.550
I equip the Equip Spell Vengeful 
Servant on Masked Knight LV3.

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:24.000
With this card, when control of 
the equipped monster changes,

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:28.600
that player takes damage equal to the 
monster's original attack points.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.870
What?

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:34.980
It's the End Phase.  Control of 
Masked Knight reverts back to you.

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:41.490
Taste the attack of the betrayer!

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.260
Izayoi is terrifying!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:55.760
Due to the Mark of the Rose and Vengeful 
Servant combo, the knight took a lot of damage!

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.090
My fight is only beginning.

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:02.460
I activate the trap card Level Change!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:06.320
This card activates during the 
opponent's turn's End Phase.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.610
I send a LV monster on my 
field to the graveyard.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.670
This allows me to Special Summon 
a monster from my graveyard

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:16.470
without having to fulfill 
its summoning requirements!

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:19.940
Resurrect, Masked Knight LV5!

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:25.630
Well done!  The Special Summon 
broke her continuous combo!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.080
Black Garden activates.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:40.960
Next, Rose Token is Special 
Summoned.  I end my turn.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:45.050
Witch!  Even if you hide in your 
sinister garden, it's no use!

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:48.050
The sword of justice will pursue 
you no matter where you are!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.090
I draw!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:54.350
At this moment, Masked 
Knight LV5 evolves to LV7!

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:55.660
That's right!

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:01.800
Due to its monster effect, Masked Knight LV5 
levels up to LV7 during the Standby Phase!

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:05.680
Come, Masked Knight LV7!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.510
Black Garden activates.

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:34.390
Rose Token is Special Summoned.

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:39.920
I get it.  Rose Token cannot 
be destroyed in battle.

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:44.250
Her strategy is to hide among 
the trees to protect herself.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:49.220
However, the opponent has sharp 
attacks.  Can she avoid them?

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:53.630
Those eyes…

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:57.570
I know what you're thinking.  When 
the monster effect activates,

00:15:57.570 --> 00:16:00.970
you intend to counterattack 
with Doppelganger.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:03.580
However, I have a plan!

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:08.570
I equip the Equip Spell Glory 
Shield on Masked Knight LV7!

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:10.750
That was well done!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:14.640
When a monster equipped 
with Glory Shield attacks,

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:17.640
you can't activate a spell 
or trap card against it!

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:22.960
And if it deals battle damage, it 
can destroy one spell or trap card.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:28.460
Battle!  Masked Knight 
LV7 attacks Rose Token!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:32.950
Persona Big Slash!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.340
He did it!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:39.170
Masked Knight's attack finally struck Izayoi!

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:44.940
Rose Token cannot be destroyed in 
battle, but she still takes damage!

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:49.250
Due to the effect of Glory 
Shield, destroy Doppelganger!

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:53.420
Now there's nothing you can do.  Take this!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.140
Persona Big Blast!

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:07.880
He did it!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:13.120
She has 50 life points remaining!  Izayoi 
survived by the skin of her teeth!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:19.390
But since she only has three Rose TokenS on 
her field, she can't do anything to oppose him!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.100
Looks like it's over.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.630
The battle isn't over yet.

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:29.070
You seem to support her a lot.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:33.030
Witch, this is your last turn!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:35.850
You have nowhere to escape!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:40.470
Yes.  It will be over this turn.

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:41.670
What?

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.340
I draw.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.710
Don't be scared.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.670
This is the witch's strategy.  
I clearly have the advantage.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:55.940
The only thing the witch can do is release 
her Rose Tokens to Advance Summon.

00:17:55.940 --> 00:18:00.640
Then with the effect of Black Garden, 
she's planning to summon a monster

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:05.040
and use it to attack the Rose Token 
that will appear on my field.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:09.210
However, she will be committing 
suicide if she does that.

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:13.150
Because my set card is Martyr Flag.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:19.420
When this card activates, Masked Knight 
LV7's attack points will be doubled.

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:22.130
Bring it!  I'll counterattack you!

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:28.110
The Field Spell Black Garden's effect.

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.420
What's happening?

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:37.430
I destroy this card and all 
Plant-Type monsters on the field.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:40.430
I can Special Summon a monster from 
my graveyard that has the same number

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.530
of attack points as the total number of 
attack points of the destroyed monsters.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:44.520
What?

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:45.660
What?

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:47.020
It can't be!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:54.210
If she destroys the three Rose Tokens that 
have 800 attack points each, the total is 2400!

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.780
That means the monster she's 
summoning will definitely be...

00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:00.090
It's that demon again!

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.930
I summon Black Rose Dragon!

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.840
There it is!

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:16.630
Black Rose Dragon!  But she 
paid a big price for it!

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:23.190
Since Black Garden's curse is gone, Masked 
Knight LV7's attack points return to 2900!

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:27.900
Since Black Rose Dragon has 2400 
attack points, it's not enough.

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:30.580
Why did you get rid of Black Garden?

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:34.200
You willingly gave up victory!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.990
Witch, have you lost your 
mind due to the pressure?

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:41.000
It's just as he says.  This battle is over.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:43.610
Yes.  The girl has won.

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:44.800
What?

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:50.630
Black Rose Dragon's monster effect.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:57.380
By removing a Plant-Type monster in my graveyard 
from play, your monster's attack points become 0.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.260
Rose Restriction.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.990
Zero attack points?

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:15.080
Even if I activate Martyr Flag and double 
its attack points, it'll still be zero!

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:17.690
Battle.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:23.480
To the knight who falsely claims justice, 
you will take my flame of cold sorrow.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.530
Don't do it.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.200
Don't do it!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.440
Black Rose Flare!

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:35.680
This is the same as a direct attack!

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:44.780
We witnessed the power of a psychic duelist.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.970
But what about our main concern?

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:53.260
Well...  It's too bad, 
but there was no signal.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.220
I see.

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:04.900
A detestable mark…

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:08.490
What is it?  Are you feeling sick?

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:23.030
Run away!  A duel shouldn't be like this!

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:23.910
You witch!

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:25.790
Capture the witch!

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.730
Well done, Izayoi.

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:36.910
But don't be too proud of your victory 
because your battle is only beginning.

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:39.720
Go away, witch!  Go away!

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:40.920
Hurry up and leave!

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.430
Leave, witch!

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:43.210
Go away!

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:45.040
Leave this city!

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:09.660
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:15.050
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:20.980
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.130 --> 00:22:26.210
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:29.380
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:34.970
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:42.130
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:47.530
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.960 --> 00:22:53.470
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.810
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.340 --> 00:23:04.870
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:14.320
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
